    "启动时向 GitHub 问一次最新的版本号，请求里没有任何关于你的东西。有新版本时，菜单栏的菜单里会出现更新按钮，更新前会校验下载的文件，并确认它和你手上这份是同一个签名身份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On launch, asks GitHub for the latest version number, and tells it nothing about you. When there is a newer one, an update button appears in the menu bar menu. Before anything is installed the download is checked against its checksum and confirmed to carry the same signing identity as the copy you already have."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时向 GitHub 问一次最新的版本号，请求里没有任何关于你的东西。有新版本时，菜单栏的菜单里会出现更新按钮，更新前会校验下载的文件，并确认它和你手上这份是同一个签名身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在菜单栏显示图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show icon in the menu bar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在菜单栏显示图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
